    {
      "id": "Localizable::Run Hermex actions like New Chat from Siri, Spotlight, the Lock Screen, or the iPhone Action button. Open Hermex Settings to manage its Siri & Search options. To assign an action to the Action button, open the iOS Settings app, choose Action Button, then Shortcut, and pick a Hermex action.",
      "catalog": "Localizable",
      "key": "Run Hermex actions like New Chat from Siri, Spotlight, the Lock Screen, or the iPhone Action button. Open Hermex Settings to manage its Siri & Search options. To assign an action to the Action button, open the iOS Settings app, choose Action Button, then Shortcut, and pick a Hermex action.",
      "units": [
        {
          "source": "Run Hermex actions like New Chat from Siri, Spotlight, the Lock Screen, or the iPhone Action button. Open Hermex Settings to manage its Siri & Search options. To assign an action to the Action button, open the iOS Settings app, choose Action Button, then Shortcut, and pick a Hermex action."
        }
      ],
      "sourceStructure": null,
      "placeholders": [],
      "protectedTerms": [
        "Hermex",
        "Siri",
        "iOS"
      ],
      "comment": null,
      "extractionState": null,
      "surface": "shared-catalog",
      "sourceReferences": [],
      "target": "Executa accions de Hermex com «Xat nou» des de Siri, Spotlight, la pantalla de bloqueig o el botó d'Acció de l'iPhone. Obre la Configuració de Hermex per gestionar-ne les opcions de Siri i Cerca. Per assignar una acció al botó d'Acció, obre l'app Configuració d'iOS, tria «Botó d'acció», després «Drecera», i escull una acció de Hermex."
    },
